        <mxCell id="_iKElun7AblGQU-SturG-6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2CBD5;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#16202B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.00789417px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;⑦ 영상 발행 (독립 타이머) - image_publish_hz 10.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;preview_frame&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.00789417px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt; 공유 변수로만 만난다 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.00789417px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;· 오버레이만 낸다,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.00789417px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;첫 검출 주기 전에는 아무것도 안 낸다 - &lt;/span&gt;떨어지지 않는다&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="52" width="420" x="18852" y="11828" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sOfq9NzT-7iqfco4Ug7B-3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#C2CBD5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#16202B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=5;strokeWidth=1.2;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;manual_pair (응답)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot; color=&quot;#0B5FA5&quot;&gt;srv/ManualPair.Response(accepted, reason)&lt;br&gt;ALREADY_PAIRED | NO_TARGET | TOO_FAR | WRONG_ROBOT | GATE_OK&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;&quot; color=&quot;#8A97A6&quot;&gt;거부 사유 5종 · 계약 10.5 표&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="86" width="330" x="12652" y="14918" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sOfq9NzT-7iqfco4Ug7B-4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F9FB;strokeColor=#BCC6D1;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#4C5A68;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;명시 페어링 폴백 (FR-13 · 계약 10절) — 구현 완료 9/9 (PR #53)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;① 손 들기&lt;/b&gt; 작업자가 보이는데 게이트를 &lt;b&gt;gate_fail_s(30 s)&lt;/b&gt; 못 넘으면 pair_state = GATE_FAIL → 관제 UI 에 버튼. 안 보이는 동안은 세지 않는다 (계약 10.1)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;② 확정&lt;/b&gt; 수락하면 paired · worker_id 를 &lt;b&gt;여기서만&lt;/b&gt; 낸다 (10.4). 그때 가리킨 사람의 복장으로 대상을 잠가 자동 게이트가 못 뒤집는다&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;③ 해제&lt;/b&gt; mission/finish 로만 풀린다 (10.6). finish 없이 다른 작업자가 배정되면 잠금을 풀고 자동 게이트부터 다시&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;④ 프레임 끊김&lt;/b&gt; 후보를 &lt;b&gt;target_stale_s(1 s)&lt;/b&gt; 넘게 못 보면 NO_TARGET 으로 내려 버튼을 거둔다 — 버튼만 뜨고 요청은 거절되는 모순 방지 (I-045)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="86" width="1468" x="11492" y="15300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sOfq9NzT-7iqfco4Ug7B-6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2CBD5;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#16202B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑦&lt;/b&gt; 폴백 상태 — &lt;b&gt;보이는데 못 넘는 시간&lt;/b&gt;을 잰다&lt;br&gt;gate_fail_s(30 s) 넘으면 pair_state = GATE_FAIL · 안 보이면 0 으로" vertex="1">
